KaTeX 0.19.1 (https://katex.org), MIT license (see LICENSE), used by web/index.html to typeset
the TeX of results. Unmodified files from the npm package katex@0.19.1:

  katex.min.js, katex.min.css   from dist/
  fonts/*.woff2                 from dist/fonts/ (the CSS lists woff2 first, so browsers never
                                fetch the .woff/.ttf variants, which are left out)
  LICENSE                       from the package root

package.json only marks katex.min.js (a UMD script) as CommonJS for Node, where web/package.json
would otherwise make it an ES module; tests/node_e2e.mjs loads it with createRequire.

To update, replace these files with the same ones from a newer package.
